# 3 passed

# Simulate the exact cron pitfall: ambient key present, suite must stay dry-run & offline
DUCKBRAIN_API_KEY=real-cron-key npx vitest run test/consolidate.test.ts
# still 3 passed, no network calls (vi mock assert holds)
```

### V3. Manual dry-run against a fixture tree
```bash
