Expected output (abr):
```
===== duckbrain consolidate =====
target    : 2026-01-14 (UTC)
namespaces: 2
  acme         rows=3 unique=2 dups=1
      - alpha
      - beta
  beta         rows=1 unique=1 dups=0
      - gamma
